d:#AACCFF\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">15 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><b><a href=\"/page/DDO_Store\" title=\"DDO Store\">DDO Store</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +3 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><a href=\"/page/Stone_of_Change\" title=\"Stone of Change\">Stone of Change</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Enhanced_Stormreach_Marketplace_Shield_(angular)\" title=\"Item:Enhanced Stormreach Marketplace Shield (angular)\">Enhanced Stormreach Marketplace Shield (angular)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>This shield depicts the market place tent, center of Stormreach commerce and trade and beating heart of the city.</i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>You can change the appearance of the <a href=\"/page/Item:Battered_Marketplace_Shield_(angular)\" title=\"Item:Battered Marketplace Shield (angular)\">Battered Marketplace Shield (angular)</a> with the Stormreach Marketplace Shield (angular) by placing both shields into the <a href=\"/page/Stone_of_Change\" title=\"Stone of Change\">Stone of Change</a>, combine and you'll have the <a href=\"/page/Item:Enhanced_Stormreach_Marketplace_Shield_(angular)\" title=\"Item:Enhanced Stormreach Marketplace Shield (angular)\">Enhanced Stormreach Marketplace Shield (angular)</a>.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816222141\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.134 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3361/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23689/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6130/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n114.49%  138.262     38 Template:IO\n100.00%  120.766      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  120.766      1 -total\n 95.82%  115.717      1 Template:Named_Shield\n 42.80%   51.685      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 41.05%   49.576      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 37.80%   45.654    